### =========================================================================
### SEARCH SERVICE HTTP TEST SUITE (P3)
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7000

### 1. Health Check & Operational Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status

### 2. Get Available Search Filters (Languages & Years)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/filters

### =========================================================================
### SEARCH TESTS (`GET /search`)
### =========================================================================

### 3. Basic Keyword Search (Mandatory parameter 'q')
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure

### 4. Search with Individual Filter (Language = English)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&language=en

### 5. Search with Individual Filter (Author substring case-insensitive = twain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&author=twain

### 6. Search with Individual Filter (Publication Year = 1885)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&year=1885

### 7. Search with Combined Filters (Author, Language, and Year)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&author=twain&language=en&year=1885

### 8. Search with Pagination (Offset 0, Limit 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&offset=0&limit=5

### 9. Search with Pagination (Offset 5, Limit 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&offset=5&limit=5

### 10. Search with No Results (Returns 200 OK with empty results array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=nonexistentterm123456789

### 11. Search with Stop Word (Returns 200 OK with empty results array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=the

### =========================================================================
### ERROR HANDLING VALIDATION TESTS (Expected 400 Bad Request)
### =========================================================================

### 12. Error: Missing mandatory 'q' parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/search

### 13. Error: Malformed limit parameter (limit = -1, out of bounds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&limit=-1

### 14. Error: Malformed limit parameter (limit = 200, exceeds max 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&limit=200

### 15. Error: Malformed limit parameter (limit = abc, not an integer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&limit=abc

### 16. Error: Malformed year parameter (year = abc, not an integer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&year=abc

### 17. Error: Malformed year parameter (year = 999, not a 4-digit year)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&year=999

### 18. Error: Malformed offset parameter (offset = -5, negative)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&offset=-5

### 19. Error: Malformed offset parameter (offset = xyz, not an integer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&offset=xyz

### 20. Error: Unsupported language code (e.g. klingon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=adventure&language=klingon

### =========================================================================
### BOOK METADATA TESTS (`GET /books/{id}`)
### =========================================================================

### 21. Get Book Metadata by ID (Existing Book)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### 22. Get Book Metadata by ID (Non-existent Book - Expected 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/99999999
